1.8 Conclusion
The goal of this chapter is to explain how a collaborative statistician or data scientist who wants to have more positive impact on society can create a statistical collaboration laboratory, what such a stat lab does, and how stat labs can be created and sustained to become engines for development. We hope this article provides a useful guide for such collaborative statisticians or data scientists that can also be used to help convince academic staff and administrators to support the creation and sustainable activities of stat labs. When operated on the strong and sustainable path, a virtuous cycle of development emerges in which initial collaborations build the capacity of all parties to achieve even more positive development outcomes, enabling the stat lab to achieve its extraordinary potential to apply statistics and data science to positively impact humanity.
